       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-QUARTER-SEAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-QUARTER-SEAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-COMPUTATIONAL-TOTALITY   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LIE-WEYL-ISOMORPHISM-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-VERLET-HARDWARE-PHYSICS  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DISPATCH-MINIMAL-ENERGY  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUARTER-MILLENNIUM-SEAL  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-QUARTER-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-250-THEOREMS-PROVEN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-QUARTER-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TOTALITY-AND-LIE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-PHYSICS-AND-ENERGY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-QUARTER-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TOTALITY-AND-LIE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMPUTATIONAL-TOTALITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LIE-WEYL-ISOMORPHISM-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-PHYSICS-AND-ENERGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VERLET-HARDWARE-PHYSICS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DISPATCH-MINIMAL-ENERGY.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-QUARTER-PROOFS.
           IF WS-COMPUTATIONAL-TOTALITY = 1 AND
              WS-LIE-WEYL-ISOMORPHISM-OK = 1 AND
              WS-VERLET-HARDWARE-PHYSICS = 1 AND
              WS-DISPATCH-MINIMAL-ENERGY = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-QUARTER-MILLENNIUM-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-250-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-QUARTER-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-250-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-QUARTER-CODE.
